ities Covered</div></div></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"py-32 px-6 sm:px-10 bg-brand-light\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"mb-20 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4\">The Standard of Excellence.</h2><p class=\"text-black/60 font-medium leading-relaxed\">We manage every step of the culinary journey to guarantee that your food arrives fresh, hot, and beautiful.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-black/5 rounded-[32px] p-10 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-brand-primary/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-brand-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-utensils w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 2v7c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h4a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V2\"></path><path d=\"M7 2v20\"></path><path d=\"M21 15V2a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v6c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h3Zm0 0v7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Master Chefs</h3><p class=\"text-black/60 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed\">Expertly curated menus using the finest locally sourced ingredients.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-black/5 rounded-[32px] p-10 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-brand-primary/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-brand-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Cloud Kitchens</h3><p class=\"text-black/60 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed\">State-of-the-art facilities designed purely for delivery perfection.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-black/5 rounded-[32px] p-10 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-brand-primary/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-brand-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">White-glove Delivery</h3><p class=\"text-black/60 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed\">Trained professionals ensuring your food arrives exactly as intended.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"app\" class=\"py-24 px-6 sm:px-10 bg-brand-dark text-white relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-primary/20 rounded-full blur-[100px] -translate-y-1/2 -z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center relative z-10\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-xs font-semibold text-white mb-6 border border-white/10 w-fit\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-smartphone w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg>Zero Storage Space Required</div><h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight mb-6 tracking-tight\">Instant App.<br/><span class=\"text-brand-primary\">Infinite Flavor.</span></h2><p class=\"text-white/70 text-lg md:text-xl font-medium mb-10 max-w-md leading-relaxed\">We engineered the 2QT App using Next-Gen PWA technology. That means no App Store or Play Store downloads, zero updates to manage, and it takes up literally 0MB of storage on your phone.</p><ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-10\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-white/90 font-medium\"><div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-primary fill-current\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg></div>Live turn-by-turn order tracking</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-white/90 font-medium\"><div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-primary fill-current\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.